codex
- **Line 304, brace walker counts braces inside strings.**  
  Exact `MDRTB_BPAL_REVIEW.html` input: `<script>const app={ realData: { a: { text: '}' }, b: { text: 'kept' } }, next: 1 };</script>`  
  Consequence: the `}` inside `'}` decrements `depth`, line 306 stops at the end of `a`, and line 316 leaves `, b: ...` after the replacement, corrupting the JS.

- **Line 292, marker can be satisfied by a comment before the real binding.**  
  Exact input: `<!-- realData: { stale: true } --><script>const app={ realData: { old: {x: 1} } };</script>`  
  Consequence: the script rewrites the comment block, leaves the real `app.realData` unchanged, writes the file, and returns success.

- **Lines 266, 271, 276, 281 plus 322, success is keyed to strings the fix removes and missing edits are not fatal.**  
  Exact input: `<title>Wrong</title><script>const AUTO_INCLUDE_TRIAL_IDS = new Set(['NCT999']); const cfg={ protocol:{pop:'wrong'}, nctAcronyms:{'NCT999':'Wrong'}, realData:{} };</script>`  
  Consequence: stages 1-4 silently do nothing, `realData` is still replaced, and the wrapper exits `0` although the title, auto-include IDs, protocol, and acronyms remain wrong.

- **Line 21, relative path can edit a different copy than the one intended.**  
  Exact input/invocation: root has `F:\rapidmeta-ssot-shell\MDRTB_BPAL_REVIEW.html`, scripts dir also has `F:\rapidmeta-ssot-shell\scripts\MDRTB_BPAL_REVIEW.html`, run `cd scripts; python build_mdrtb_bpal_app.py`.  
  Consequence: the script edits `scripts\MDRTB_BPAL_REVIEW.html`, while any root-served dashboard remains unchanged.

